# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo on every platform. This registry is
# a byte-compared artifact: `paniolo skills bundle --check` diffs it against the
# wiki source, and consumers verify each SKILL.md against the `computedHash` in
# their skills-lock.json. A CRLF file authored on Windows changes both without
# changing a single rendered character.
* text=auto eol=lf
